Proposed Solution

FARLIGHT is an interactive planetary archaeology experience that transforms documented NASA mission histories into engaging investigations of the machines left behind on the Moon and Mars.

Through interactive storytelling and evidence-based exploration, users can discover each machine's original purpose, engineering, mission milestones, scientific contributions, and eventual fate.

Inteded Impact

FARLIGHT aims to help scholl-age audiences and casual space enthusiasts better undersatnd the engineering achievements, scientific discoveries, and lasting contributions of humanity's planetary explorers.
